<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.SetAgentEnvironment(agent_id: uuid, transition: number, Settings: {any}): number`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer llSetAgentEnvironment(key agent_id, float transition, list Settings);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>This function sets environment values for an individual agent in an experience. The changes to the environment persist until the agent moves to a new region or llSetAgentEnvironment is called for an agent with an empty list. Passing an empty list in params will strip all environmental settings applied to this agent as part of the experience</p>
  <p>Returns an integer</p>
</p>
